WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:21.740
Well, Mr. Postmaster General, I want to buy from you now six of the $25 bonds, one for

00:21.740 --> 00:26.920
each of my five grandchildren and one for myself.

00:26.920 --> 00:33.920
I hope my arithmetic is right. I figured it out that I owe you $112.50. There's $100,

00:33.920 --> 00:46.200
there's $110, $111, $112, $113. Now you owe me 50 cents.

00:46.200 --> 00:54.720
I don't know whether I have the 50 cents or not. Here it is, Mr. President, and I am sure

00:54.720 --> 00:59.600
that there will be a substantial sale of these bonds all over the country.

